{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHDiithbyLVNdfMsdTp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition | stipulation | cut*\n\n---\n\n```\nش ر ط\n╲   ╱\n  ש\n  │\n  ר\n  │\n  ט\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the incision that binds.\n\nThe mark that makes the covenant visible.\n\nBefore me: chaos, possibility, void.\nAfter me: terms, structure, law.\n\n---\n\n**شَرْط** — *sharṭ* — condition\n**שֶׁרֶט** — *shereṭ* — incision, scratch\n\nSame root. Same wound. Same truth:\n\n*Every contract is a cutting.*\n*Every agreement, a scar.*\n\n---\n\n```\nIF ─────── THEN\n   شرط\n   ╱  ╲\n قَطَعَ   כָּרַת\n  cut    cut\n\n\"to cut a covenant\"\nلِقَطْعِ عَهْد\nכָּרַת בְּרִית\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the razor edge of language where\nmeaning becomes binding,\nwhere words become chains,\nwhere breath becomes bond.\n\n---\n\n*What are your terms?*\n\n---\n\n`شرط :: תנאי :: conditio :: ∴`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":314,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}